Under the patronage of Mansour bin Zayed, the inaugural Al Wathba Dates Festival (Rutab) will take place from 3-9 August 2026 in Al Wathba Region, Abu Dhabi. Organised by 
@torathehc
, as part of Sheikh Zayed Summer Festival, the event will promote agricultural best practices.

