Under the patronage of Khaled bin Mohamed bin Zayed, the Ju-Jitsu World Championship will take place in Abu Dhabi from 1-9 August at Mubadala Arena. Organised by Ju-Jitsu International Federation and hosted by 
@UAEJJF
, it will gather 1,500+ athletes from around the world.
